{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/RedoBee.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br>Meet Bumble<br>He's a bee<br>A very belligerent bee<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/RedoFlower.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br>You see, he hates the smell of flowers<br>Help him on his taxing trial, to flatten them all<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/Gif.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br>In this fast-paced, roguelike, arcade game, you are the bad guy<br>Navigate your way through myriads of unfair matchups against the toughest ecosystem safeguards<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weave through:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>worm wardens</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/W.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>butterfly bouncers</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/BU.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>bird barriers</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/B.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>and duel defenders</li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/duel_defenders.gif?t=1722583296\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool Stuff</h2><br><strong>-Randomized Runs</strong><br>Each wave is randomly ordered, with random enemy start points; no run will be the same!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/Randomized.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><strong>-Pickup'n'Play</strong><br>Kamakazzzbee is easy to understand and start playing, with its minimalistic design, and its singular multifunctional dash ability<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/Dash.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><strong>-Difficulty</strong><br>You Will Die. A Ton. Like a Lot. Like you probably won't last a minute.  <i>(its pretty hard)</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/Dead_Steam.png?t=1722583296\" /><br><br><strong>-Addicting Gameplay</strong><br>Hard hooking gameplay that only ends with you looking up new controllers<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/Controller_Steam.png?t=1722583296\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1863120?t=1722583296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1863120?t=1722583296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1722583296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1722583296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/RedoBee.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br>Meet Bumble<br>He's a bee<br>A very belligerent bee<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1863120/extras/RedoFlower.gif?t=1722583296\" /><br>You see, he hates the smell of flowers<br>Help him on his taxing trial, to flatten them all<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com